                )
          %h4#d4d8brane_bound_states_with_d2d6brane_defects D4-D8-brane bound states with D2-D6-brane defects
          %p
            On
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/black+brane"} black
            %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
              %semantics
